    "source_assessment": "Native physical-copy lowering supports four equal-width X16/Y16/Imag16 edges. copyCost lacks them in both the inspected downstream source and extracted source. Imag32 costs and mismatched-width hint filtering are present. Pristine upstream 26d7c2c1 lacks the native entry points.",
    "binary_assessment": "Clean extracted commit 6575ff4ee7e4df21176f04f22eda39a62ccadb3a produced the preserved LLVM 24 assertions binary. Exact original IR files abort in Greedy allocation; verifier-clean pre-Greedy MIR is retained. Candidate ae0c0b6d2121 changes only copy costs and adds regression coverage.",
