  "resolution": {
    "change": "ae0c0b6d2121 (extracted compiler source); retained repair.diff",
    "causal_explanation": "getRegAllocationHints asks copyCost to score legal equal-width copies between Imag16 and Xc16/Yc16. No matching arm existed, so the allocator reached llvm_unreachable. The four cost arms match the already implemented LDX/LDY/STX/STY direct-page lowering.",
    "trigger_check": "Original pre-Greedy MIR has %7:xc16 = COPY %0:imag16. The focused MIR allocates X16 and Y16 copies to and from Imag16. Original two IR inputs and the focused MIR fail on the unchanged baseline and pass with the cost change; 156 supported MOS CodeGen/MC files pass, one unrelated file is unsupported. Runtime execution of the affected far-indexed paths is recorded separately with the completed prerequisite series.",
